k nothing"},{"time":72.72,"end":75.73,"text":"Almighty God, loving Lord"},{"time":75.73,"end":79.19,"text":"You help me with Your smiling face"},{"time":79.19,"end":82.58,"text":"My strength and salvation"},{"time":82.58,"end":85.79,"text":"My fortress and strong tower"},{"time":85.79,"end":89.32,"text":"Who supports me as You do?"},{"time":89.32,"end":94.21,"text":"You answer my cry"},{"time":94.21,"end":97.52,"text":"I will lift my head"},{"time":97.52,"end":100.96,"text":"And look to the Lord Jesus Christ"},{"time":100.96,"end":103.21,"text":"The King of glory"},{"time":103.21,"end":107.81,"text":"My shield on every side"},{"time":107.81,"end":110.8,"text":"I will lift my head"},{"time":110.8,"end":114.73,"text":"I will sing hallelujah aloud"},{"time":114.73,"end":116.28,"text":"I will declare aloud"},{"time":116.28,"end":121.05,"text":"All my life I will overcome through the Lord"},{"time":121.05,"end":124.9,"text":"","kind":"instrumental"},{"time":124.9,"end":131.43,"text":"You know me by name"},{"time":131.43,"end":137.38,"text":"Your unceasing love embraces me"},{"time":137.38,"end":144.64,"text":"You clothe me in righteousness and holiness"},{"time":144.64,"end":150.59,"text":"You let my life reflect God’s honor"},{"time":150.59,"end":151.11,"text":"","kind":"instrumental"},{"time":151.11,"end":154.09,"text":"I will not lose heart or courage"},{"time":154.09,"end":157.36,"text":"Trusting in the Lord, I will lack nothing"},{"time":157.36,"end":160.6,"text":"Almighty God, loving Lord"},{"time":160.6,"end":164.3,"text":"You help me with Your smiling face"},{"time":164.3,"end":167.74,"text":"My strength and salvation"},{"time":167.74,"end":170.81,"text":"My fortress and strong tower"},{"time":170.81,"end":173.91,"text":"Who supports me as You do?"},{"time":173.91,"end":178.94,"text":"You answer my cry"},{"time":178.94,"end":182.24,"text":"I will lift my head"},{"time":182.24,"end":185.8,"text":"And look to the Lord Jesus Christ"},{"time":185.8,"end":188.06,"text